    "attributes": {
        "action": "Hold a referendum on reinstating capital punishment",
        "additional_details": "We believe there should be a national referendum on whether the most heinous crimes - particularly those involving extreme cruelty against innocent and defenceless victims \u2014 require a sanction beyond imprisonment.",
        "background": "We call on Parliament to legislate to hold a national referendum on whether capital punishment should be reinstated for the most heinous crimes.",
